    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25598" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαπόν-ημα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hard labour, exercise,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ περὶ τὸν πόλεμον δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					813d
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> concrete,
				<i>work,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ τῶν τεκτόνων δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Criti.</u>
					114e
				</span></i>
			; <i>achievement, work done,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βασιλέως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Procop.
					<u>Aed.</u>
					2.7
				</span></i>
			; <i>thing achieved, reward of toil,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Goth.</u>
				4.19
			</span></i>.</div>
